  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Cybernetica Datasmith",
    "summary": "If this model leads a **KASTELAN ROBOTS** unit at one of these points, that unit enters a protocol:\n\n- as the battle begins, it enters Aegis Protocol\n- in your Command phase, you can pick 1 protocol below for it to enter\n\nA unit stays in a protocol until it switches to another. Each protocol affects the **KASTELAN ROBOT** models in the unit:\n\n- **Protector Protocol**: +2 Attacks for their ranged weapons\n- **Conqueror Protocol**: +2 Attacks for their melee weapons\n- **Aegis Protocol**: +1 Toughness",
